{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20266kBniM68l11792978366.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>福州有「中國金魚之都」美譽，當地一座園林式金魚館近日開館，免費對外開放。</p><p></p><p>假山、流水，充滿古典韻味，水中還有金魚暢泳。這座位於福州一個主題園區的金魚館，面積超過1,200平方米，近期開始免費對外開放，向公眾展示多個品種的「明星金魚」。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_2.J.FJ.FISH.1009-1026_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PAQ7G3MF3H1792978464.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>閩侯縣金魚協會會長張文春指出︰「這一次我們金魚館主要特點是展示為主，還有園林式的金魚館，更多讓市民知道我們福州的金魚文化這一塊，我們其實也做得非常好。」</p><p></p><p>除了游動的金魚，館中亦展出金魚相關收藏品，包括民國時期的金魚茶具，及來自海外的金魚瓷器、飾品等。公眾亦可在這裡購買金魚，帶回家飼養。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:26.549325+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:06.568937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:53.110250+00:00","content_hash":"ec837b5c75e46d2f130b406b4d6dc8d2d1410259d2f194ae830b71ca3bd7de94","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:26.549325+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}